  "review": {
    "reviewer": "Claude (m33mu web workbench session)",
    "reviewedAt": "2026-10-24",
    "note": "Signal mapping from UM3115 Rev 3 Tables 21/23/25. The provisional sprite (CN11/CN12/ZIO_*) could not be matched to CN7/CN9 and was replaced by an original to-scale redraw whose CN7/CN9 contact centres come from the Fig. 6 measurement. Only CN7-10 and CN9-1 are enabled; morpho CN12-11/13 carry the same nets but are not fitted by default and stay disabled. MB1404 schematic pack could not be downloaded (st.com timeout); a CAD-exact check against it remains open. 2026-10-24 update: enabled the CN7/CN8/CN9/CN10 contacts carrying I2C1, I2C2, SPI1, USART2, LPUART1, GND, 3V3 and 5V per UM3115 Rev 3 Tables 21-24."
  }
